        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Both already pass through [`libuv_proc_spawn()`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/src/nvim/event/libuv_proc.c#L77-L91), which handles this for `cmd.exe`:\r\n\r\n```c\r\nif (os_shell_is_cmdexe(proc->argv[0])) {\r\n  uvproc->uvopts.flags |= UV_PROCESS_WINDOWS_VERBATIM_ARGUMENTS;\r\n  // cmd.exe compatibility: backslashes required for path.\r\n  TO_BACKSLASH(proc->argv[0]);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nBut yeah let's wait till @ntdiary checks ",
